{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MonthLedger 是一款強調隱私保護與離線運作的個人財務管理應用，適合希望脫離訂閱制、不想讓銀行資料上傳至雲端的使用者。此 App 現正限時免費提供下載，原本售價為 US $0.99，用戶可一次性獲得完整功能，無需擔心廣告或內購陷阱。</p>\n\n<h2>本地優先智能記帳</h2>\n<p>本應用採用本地優先架構，所有數據僅存於裝置端，開發者無法存取交易紀錄或賬戶名稱。用戶可自定義報告週期而非受限於日曆月，支援多幣種匯率手動輸入或參考在線費率。內建預算追蹤、信用卡還款提醒及快捷指令整合，並提供 CSV 與 JSON 備份功能，確保資產記錄準確且完全由用戶掌控，真正實現無縫且安全的個人理財體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-94-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-95-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-96-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MonthLedger</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T09:31:44.718384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}